25,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes over an hour and a half. Also, outside firms require us to tidy up before they even arrive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Some of us are barely here, while a few people do almost all the cooking. The usage is totally uneven.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Our past fights are all about reminders. Even the previous tenants warned that permanent splits led to them not speaking.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Rin,,"We're buying the same spray twice! And the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour, billed to one person.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The bathroom gets dirty again in less than two weeks. Plus, we all have different ideas of what ""clean"" actually means.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, if permanent splits cause silence, we should be careful. But the time commitment is significant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If some people are away for a month, a strict rota feels unfair to those staying.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, but if we don't have a clear rule, the ""reminders"" will just keep causing rows.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Rin, wait, I mean @Victoria, the billing for a pro is a bit messy since one person has to collect the money.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, if it takes that long, maybe that's why the quality varies so much.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, it's the lack of a standard that's the problem. We need a way to ensure the work is actually done.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we use a rota, the people who only make coffee are doing as much as the heavy cooks.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We need a solution that removes the need for one person to nag another.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm worried about the cost of a pro, but the current receipt situation is a disaster.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I just want to know that the bathroom is actually scrubbed, not just wiped.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
