50,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is too risky for the atmosphere. Option B is a lot of hours. Option C is expensive but efficient.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option B feels unfair given the different usage levels. Option A is better for those who are away often.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A is a recipe for disaster based on the previous tenants. Option B is better, but C is the most peaceful.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C sounds expensive, but it solves the ""who paid for the sponges"" argument if we just have a monthly bill.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B would give me a predictable schedule, but Option C would guarantee the quality I'm looking for.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, the management fee is high. But @Victoria is right; peace is worth something.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, if we do Option B, we still have the ""what counts as done"" problem.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that's why Option C is superior. A professional has a standard we can all agree on.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Rin,,"If we do Option C, can we make sure the billing is fair and not just on one person?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm leaning towards C. I'm tired of the bathroom being a gamble.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is the most ""reasonable"" on paper, but the time cost is a burden. I'll vote C.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I still worry about the cost, but if it stops the fighting, maybe it's worth it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I cannot support Option A. Between B and C, C is the only one that ensures we stay friends.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'll vote C! It's easier to track one invoice than a hundred tiny receipts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. I'll vote for C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
