66,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'll vote C too. It's the most balanced for our different schedules.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I'm voting C.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
